{
  "id": "fizz_buzz",
  "title": "Fizz Buzz",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "category": "Algorithms",
  "tags": [
    "Math",
    "String",
    "Simulation"
  ],
  "description": "<p>Given an integer <code>n</code>, return <em>a string array </em><code>answer</code><em> (<strong>1-indexed</strong>) where</em>:</p> <ul> <li><code>answer[i] == \"FizzBuzz\"</code> if <code>i</code> is divisible by <code>3</code> and <code>5</code>.</li> <li><code>answer[i] == \"Fizz\"</code> if <code>i</code> is divisible by <code>3</code>.</li> <li><code>answer[i] == \"Buzz\"</code> if <code>i</code> is divisible by <code>5</code>.</li> <li><code>answer[i] == i</code> (as a string) if none of the above conditions are true.</li> </ul> <p> </p> <p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p> <pre><strong>Input:</strong> n = 3\n<strong>Output:</strong> [\"1\",\"2\",\"Fizz\"]\n</pre><p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p> <pre><strong>Input:</strong> n = 5\n<strong>Output:</strong> [\"1\",\"2\",\"Fizz\",\"4\",\"Buzz\"]\n</pre><p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p> <pre><strong>Input:</strong> n = 15\n<strong>Output:</strong> [\"1\",\"2\",\"Fizz\",\"4\",\"Buzz\",\"Fizz\",\"7\",\"8\",\"Fizz\",\"Buzz\",\"11\",\"Fizz\",\"13\",\"14\",\"FizzBuzz\"]\n</pre> <p> </p> <p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p> <ul> <li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li> </ul>",
  "hints": [],
